      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "=== ComfyUI Distillation Nodes Usage Guide ===\n\nSVD Backends Available:\n- aurora: AURORA-SVD (best quality, recommended)\n- drf: DRF-SVD (Dual-Residual Folding)\n- randomized: Halko et al. Algorithm 4.4\n- krylov: Block Krylov subspace\n- adaptive: Adaptive range finder\n- auto: Automatic selection based on matrix size\n\nKey Parameters:\n- rank: LoRA rank (8-256, default: 64)\n- energy_threshold: SVD energy retention (0.9-0.99)\n- use_ties: Enable TIES trimming for sparsification\n- ties_density: Fraction to keep (0.1-0.5)\n- use_dare: Enable DARE drop-and-rescale\n\nSupported Architecture Pairs:\n- SDXL ↔ SD3\n- SDXL ↔ FLUX\n- SD1.x ↔ SD2.x\n- Any ComfyUI supported models\n\nMemory Tips:\n- Use 'cpu' offload for large models\n- Reduce rank for faster processing\n- Enable mixed precision for speed"
      ],
      "title": "Usage Guide"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [750, 800],
      "size": {"0": 500, "1": 200},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 11,
      "mode": 0,
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "=== Python API Usage ===\n\nfrom custom_nodes.ComfyUI_distillation import (\n    create_distillation_engine,\n    DistillationConfig,\n    GPUAcceleratedSVD,\n    apply_dare,\n    apply_ties,\n)\n\n# Quick usage\nengine = create_distillation_engine(\n    rank=64,\n    svd_mode='aurora',\n    use_ties=True,\n)\n\nresult = engine.distill_models(\n    teacher_state_dict,\n    student_state_dict,\n)\n\nengine.save_lora_adapter(result, 'output_lora')"
      ],
      "title": "Python API Example"
    }
